{"video":"ZLt06z7VgNc","lines":[{"t":[0.3,1.7],"en":"This is my favorite part."},{"t":[1.8,2.4],"en":"Yeah, me too."},{"t":[5.3,7],"en":"You know what's sadder than this?"},{"t":[7.3,7.7],"en":"Bambi."},{"t":[8.9,10.9],"en":"I cried for three days with that movie."},{"t":[11.3,12],"en":"No, wait, two."},{"t":[12.5,14.4],"en":"Because on the third day, my mother killed herself,"},{"t":[14.4,15.7],"en":"so I was partly crying for that."},{"t":[18.4,20.5],"en":"Well, see, now that I can see crying over,"},{"t":[20.6,22.5],"en":"but Bambi is a cartoon."},{"t":[22.9,24.6],"en":"You didn't cry when Bambi's mother died?"},{"t":[24.8,27.6],"en":"Yes, it was very sad when the guy stopped drawing the deer."},{"t":[30,32.6],"en":"You know, Chandler, there's nothing wrong with crying."},{"t":[32.9,34.8],"en":"You don't have to be so macho all the time."},{"t":[35.2,36],"en":"I'm not macho."},{"t":[37.1,38],"en":"Yeah, you're right."},{"t":[39.6,40.7],"en":"I don't know what I was thinking."},{"t":[42,44],"en":"Well, I guess I just never really cried, you know?"},{"t":[44,45.4],"en":"I'm not a crying kind of guy."},{"t":[45.8,46.6],"en":"Come on, man."},{"t":[46.6,48.5],"en":"There's got to be something that gets you choked up."},{"t":[49.1,53.2],"en":"Like, uh, what if you saw a three-legged puppy?"},{"t":[55.2,56.6],"en":"I'd be sad, sure."},{"t":[57.5,58.6],"en":"But I wouldn't cry."},{"t":[59,61],"en":"Okay, uh, what if the puppy said,"},{"t":[61.4,62.3],"en":"Help me, Chandler."},{"t":[64.8,66.9],"en":"All the other puppies pick on me."},{"t":[68.7,69.1],"en":"Cry?"},{"t":[69.6,71.2],"en":"I just found a talking puppy."},{"t":[71.3,71.9],"en":"I'm rich."},{"t":[73.4,75.4],"en":"Oh, I've got it."},{"t":[75.5,76.5],"en":"I have got it."},{"t":[76.9,78.8],"en":"Pictures from your childhood."},{"t":[79.1,80.3],"en":"This will get you going good."},{"t":[82.6,84.1],"en":"All right, what's going on there?"},{"t":[84.4,86.4],"en":"Oh, that's Parents' Day, first grade."},{"t":[86.6,87.8],"en":"That's me with the..."},{"t":[87.8,89.2],"en":"The janitor, Martin."},{"t":[90.6,91.5],"en":"Where are your parents?"},{"t":[91.6,92.3],"en":"Oh, they didn't want to come."},{"t":[93.3,94.4],"en":"Oh, Chandler."},{"t":[94.9,95.7],"en":"Poor thing."},{"t":[96,97.6],"en":"So that story doesn't make you cry?"},{"t":[98.2,99.8],"en":"No, look, I don't cry."},{"t":[99.9,101.1],"en":"It's not a big deal, okay?"},{"t":[101.6,103.1],"en":"No, it's not okay."},{"t":[104.1,105.5],"en":"It's not okay at all."},{"t":[107.2,108.4],"en":"You're dead inside."},{"t":[113.7,114.4],"en":"Hey, sweetie."},{"t":[114.6,114.8],"en":"Hey."},{"t":[120.1,121.6],"en":"Chicken soup for the soul?"},{"t":[123.4,125.1],"en":"There's no back to this couch."},{"t":[127.6,128.7],"en":"Why are you reading this?"},{"t":[128.8,129.7],"en":"You hate this kind of stuff."},{"t":[129.9,130.4],"en":"Yeah, I know."},{"t":[130.4,131.4],"en":"I figured I'd give it a shot."},{"t":[131.5,132],"en":"You know, I mean,"},{"t":[132,132.9],"en":"maybe one of those stories"},{"t":[132.9,133.7],"en":"would make me cry"},{"t":[133.7,134.7],"en":"and then you wouldn't think"},{"t":[134.7,135.3],"en":"I was, you know,"},{"t":[135.3,136.3],"en":"all dead inside."},{"t":[137.2,139],"en":"Oh, that's so sweet."},{"t":[139.6,140.5],"en":"Chandler, I don't care"},{"t":[140.5,141.1],"en":"if you can't cry."},{"t":[141.2,141.8],"en":"I love you."},{"t":[142.1,143.1],"en":"Oh, that makes me feel"},{"t":[143.1,145.2],"en":"so warm in my hollow tin chest."},{"t":[147.2,147.9],"en":"Stop it."},{"t":[148.4,149.6],"en":"No, I mean, come on, seriously."},{"t":[149.8,150.2],"en":"Think about it."},{"t":[150.2,150.7],"en":"We get married,"},{"t":[150.8,151.5],"en":"I'm up at the altar"},{"t":[151.5,152.4],"en":"and I'm like this."},{"t":[155.2,156.2],"en":"I won't care"},{"t":[156.2,157.3],"en":"because I know"},{"t":[157.3,158],"en":"that you'll be feeling"},{"t":[158,159.4],"en":"it all in here."},{"t":[160.6,161],"en":"Yeah?"},{"t":[161.3,161.7],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[162.2,163.6],"en":"And if we have a baby one day"},{"t":[163.6,165.9],"en":"and the doctor hands it to you"},{"t":[165.9,166.9],"en":"in the delivery room"},{"t":[166.9,168.7],"en":"and you don't cry,"},{"t":[169.5,170.2],"en":"so what?"},{"t":[171.3,173.1],"en":"And if we take him to college"},{"t":[173.1,173.9],"en":"and we come home"},{"t":[173.9,175.6],"en":"and we see his empty room"},{"t":[175.6,176.8],"en":"for the first time"},{"t":[176.8,179],"en":"and you got nothing,"},{"t":[179.4,182.2],"en":"it won't matter to me."},{"t":[185.1,185.5],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[187,188.2],"en":"Well, I won't worry"},{"t":[188.2,189.2],"en":"about this anymore then."},{"t":[189.4,190.5],"en":"Yeah, and, you know,"},{"t":[190.6,191.3],"en":"if I die"},{"t":[191.3,195.7],"en":"from a long illness"},{"t":[195.7,197.4],"en":"and you're writing out"},{"t":[197.4,198.1],"en":"my eulogy"},{"t":[198.1,200],"en":"and you open the desk drawer"},{"t":[200,201.5],"en":"and you find a note for me"},{"t":[201.5,202],"en":"that says,"},{"t":[202.2,204.8],"en":"I will always be with you"},{"t":[204.8,207.9],"en":"and you still can't shed"},{"t":[207.9,209.5],"en":"one tiny tear,"},{"t":[210.2,212.4],"en":"I know you'll be crying"},{"t":[212.4,213.6],"en":"a river inside."},{"t":[215.1,216.3],"en":"Oh, I love you so much."},{"t":[216.3,217.4],"en":"What is wrong with you?"},{"t":[219.3,219.7],"en":"What?"},{"t":[220.2,220.4],"en":"What?"},{"t":[220.6,221.9],"en":"You can't shed a tear"},{"t":[221.9,222.9],"en":"for your dead wife!"},{"t":[223.4,224.8],"en":"Now, I left you a note"},{"t":[224.8,225.6],"en":"from the beyond!"},{"t":[226.1,227.4],"en":"So you didn't mean any of that?"},{"t":[227.5,228.7],"en":"No, you robot!"},{"t":[231.6,232.1],"en":"I..."},{"t":[232.1,233.9],"en":"I don't even know what to say."},{"t":[239.1,239.8],"en":"Thank you."},{"t":[242.5,243.3],"en":"You're welcome."},{"t":[243.3,251.7],"en":"Oh, my God."},{"t":[251.9,252.8],"en":"Are you crying?"},{"t":[253.1,254.1],"en":"I just don't see"},{"t":[254.1,254.7],"en":"why those two"},{"t":[254.7,255.9],"en":"can't work things up."}]}
